# Copy this file outside the repository and provide only environment variables
# needed by the Codex model provider configured in your adjudicator config.toml.
#
# Example:
# CODEX_PROXY_TOKEN=replace-me
#
# IMPORTANT:
# Do not put TYPESAFE_API_KEY or any TYPESAFE_* variable in this file.
# The Docker launcher rejects TypeSafe credentials because oracle adjudicators
# must not receive semantic-provider credentials or treatment access.
